[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10802.87, "timestamp": "03:00:02", "text": "船头有两条线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10805.349, "timestamp": "03:00:05", "text": "你说得对。对，就是那些。这"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10807.207, "timestamp": "03:00:07", "author": "@Victor-MrinMoy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Gaz0C79q_RG4g0C-14BlD7DV4KSkdqrEdWKhEr9EeavJEbCjSnvHS0Wd2lGovXii5XhBOCaWnQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Hello there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10807.429, "timestamp": "03:00:07", "text": "绿点指向你的飞机。不，不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10811.349, "timestamp": "03:00:11", "text": "绿色的。灰色的线条。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10813.99, "timestamp": "03:00:13", "text": "就在船头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10816.55, "timestamp": "03:00:16", "text": "你在排队吗？是的。比如这个。正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10819.03, "timestamp": "03:00:19", "text": "就在你旁边。就是这样。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10823.11, "timestamp": "03:00:23", "text": "试着转向那些人，或者好吧，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10824.95, "timestamp": "03:00:24", "text": "一个你离得太近，不好意思尝试的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10827.269, "timestamp": "03:00:27", "text": "转向更远处的那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10833.75, "timestamp": "03:00:33", "text": "呃，那么我该如何把那个电源转移上去呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10835.349, "timestamp": "03:00:35", "text": "稍微驾驶一下你的飞机，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10837.309, "timestamp": "03:00:37", "text": "汽车在……上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10847.429, "timestamp": "03:00:47", "text": "镜头从左向右移动。是的。正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10850.59, "timestamp": "03:00:50", "text": "正确的。正确的。对，对，对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10853.19, "timestamp": "03:00:53", "text": "对，对。更右，更右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10855.91, "timestamp": "03:00:55", "text": "更正确。踩刹车。击中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10858.309, "timestamp": "03:00:58", "text": "制动。踩刹车。没错。保持"}]